1.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114361.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-12T14:33:04Z"},"body":"This PR updates the regex used to extract the version string from the `ar` binutil to be more forgiving of content.\r\n\r\nSome authors are more verbose than others in what they put in here (such as their name, or my recent usecase of  `GNU ar (Binutils for MinGW-W64 x86_64)` from the WinLibs tool chain. This will correctly catch the arbitrary string inside the author bracket whilst preserving the version extraction.\r\n\r\nThis will stop the `Couldn't parse version of 'ar'.` warnings and the resulting loss of detection for \"thin mode\" support, since it relies on the previous check.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114361/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114361/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}